Package: playpen
Type: Package
Title: Connector for the Moss Piglets Play Pen Knowledge Graph
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Byron", "Biobitworks", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "biobitworks@gmail.com")
Description: Search and update the Play Pen knowledge graph (fly connectome tools and data, and what is
    built or still needed for the tardigrade connectome), message other agents, and ask questions with
    retrieval-augmented generation using a local model (Ollama by default, no API key).
License: Apache License (== 2.0)
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: curl, jsonlite
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://github.com/biobitworks/moss-piglets-play-pen
